  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJLCOBN.png\" alt=\"doorsmcw\" width=\"1299\" height=\"683\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&label=Twitter&logo=twitter&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&logo=discord&logoColor=f&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"關於\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否曾經希望每個原版門都有更多木材變體？或者你只是想要一些全新的獨特門？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">那麼，我向你推薦「Macaw's Doors」。此模組讓你有機會為原版門添加各種木材顏色。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">它也包含許多新門，例如：障子門、金屬門、監獄鐵門、現代風格門等等！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎在此留言或透過我們的 Discord 伺服器提出你的想法。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"影片\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZS7r7pqZzYg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要遊戲伺服器嗎？點擊上方圖片，使用優惠碼 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong> 即可在第一個月享受 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，盡情遊玩！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"常見問題\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">問：是否有計畫將此模組逆向移植至 1.15.2 或更低版本？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：機率極低，但未來或許會推出最終的 1.12.2 版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我可以將你的模組用於我的整合包中嗎？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需標示出處並附上 CurseForge 頁面連結即可。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">問：若有翻譯版本要提供給您，該寄送至哪裡？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可透過 GitHub 或我們的 Discord 伺服器傳送。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpZJ9zN.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1477\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
